<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <main class="stage">
    <section class="card">
      <div class="statusline">
        <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="statuscode"><%= method %> <%= path %></span>
        <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        <span class="statuscode ok">200 OK</span>
      </div>

      <h1>Hello, World</h1>

      <p class="lede">
        Trang này được render hoàn toàn trên server &mdash; Express nhận request,
        controller dựng dữ liệu, và EJS trả về HTML này trước khi trình duyệt
        chạy một dòng JavaScript nào.
      </p>

      <div class="meta">
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">stack</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Express, EJS, kiến trúc MVC</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">render</span>
          <span class="meta-value">phía server</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
      <span>Tác giả</span>
      <span class="footer-author">Hỏi Dân IT</span>
      <span class="footer-handle">@hoidanit</span>
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
